{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920940/extras/9a1dc6b29011ab6e39e6201f952583e2.avif?t=1772603530\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to <strong>Bonfire Simulator!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bonfire Simulator</strong> is a realistic campfire simulation game that lets you experience the warmth and charm of tending a fire. Build your bonfire, decorate the surroundings, and enjoy a cozy and relaxing fire experience. Add logs and branches to increase the fire\u2019s strength, cook food, and arrange your camping tools. Keep in mind\u2014the changing weather can weaken your fire at any time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920940/extras/ce4c516197f51f58edabdc8bcb81546b.poster.avif?t=1772603530\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920940/extras/ce4c516197f51f58edabdc8bcb81546b.webm?t=1772603530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920940/extras/ce4c516197f51f58edabdc8bcb81546b.mp4?t=1772603530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf32 Chop trees and gather firewood to manage your bonfire.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your campfire stays alive and burns stronger when it has something combustible to feed on. <strong>Firewood</strong> is always the best choice! Trees grow naturally around you, so chop them down efficiently, gather firewood, and prepare for the night without waste.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920940/extras/c5bbdb0d518a156be7266d1defa6c138.poster.avif?t=1772603530\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920940/extras/c5bbdb0d518a156be7266d1defa6c138.webm?t=1772603530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920940/extras/c5bbdb0d518a156be7266d1defa6c138.mp4?t=1772603530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf27\ufe0f Prepare for changing weather\u2014rain, snowstorms, and more.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will encounter various weather conditions while managing their bonfire. Heavy rain can extinguish your fire, and fierce snowstorms can drain your condition, leading to game over at any moment! Fortunately, there are useful tools to help you endure these harsh environments\u2014so hang in there and survive together with your fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920940/extras/c3d36ad940be2b25569e29a785a86705.poster.avif?t=1772603530\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920940/extras/c3d36ad940be2b25569e29a785a86705.webm?t=1772603530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920940/extras/c3d36ad940be2b25569e29a785a86705.mp4?t=1772603530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf60 Cook warm and delicious food over the campfire.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No campfire is complete without food! Roast sweet potatoes, warm yourself up with instant coffee, grill fish, or simmer a hearty stew. Each dish has its own cooking method and timing, so be sure to check the manual carefully!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920940/extras/8338995a61f2b5d9718f0143991abb39.poster.avif?t=1772603530\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920940/extras/8338995a61f2b5d9718f0143991abb39.webm?t=1772603530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920940/extras/8338995a61f2b5d9718f0143991abb39.mp4?t=1772603530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 Collect embers and upgrade your personal camping spot.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the fire burns and the night deepens, fiery energy gathers and floats through the air. Click on the embers to collect them and use them in the shop. Purchase various upgrades\u2014from improving your bonfire to acquiring new ignition tools.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Deserted Island Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3920940/f4ff697c342a5fd1bc870f2b260e4048d9ac4632.jpg"},{"name":"Conqueror of the Snowy Peaks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3920940/f4ff697c342a5fd1bc870f2b260e4048d9ac4632.jpg"},{"name":"Pioneer of the Forest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3920940/f4ff697c342a5fd1bc870f2b260e4048d9ac4632.jpg"},{"name":"Prometheus","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3920940/387058c2f0dba6088c9e6b148769f37148fe0a74.jpg"},{"name":"Hestia","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3920940/387058c2f0dba6088c9e6b148769f37148fe0a74.jpg"},{"name":"Hephaestus","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3920940/f4ff697c342a5fd1bc870f2b260e4048d9ac4632.jpg"},{"name":"Brigid","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3920940/664cb84f1a383f8c9581499d57cce2b7450b4b36.jpg"},{"name":"Firewood Factory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3920940/f4ff697c342a5fd1bc870f2b260e4048d9ac4632.jpg"},{"name":"It Happens...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3920940/387058c2f0dba6088c9e6b148769f37148fe0a74.jpg"},{"name":"Trees Tremble Before Me","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3920940/387058c2f0dba6088c9e6b148769f37148fe0a74.jpg"}],"total":28},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3920940?t=1772603530","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3920940?t=1772603530","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920940/a3aeb6625eb66173a3ba749448d4ce0f2928f103/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772603530","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920940/a3aeb6625eb66173a3ba749448d4ce0f2928f103/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772603530","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920940/extras/9a1dc6b29011ab6e39e6201f952583e2.avif?t=1772603530\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to <strong>Bonfire Simulator!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bonfire Simulator</strong> is a realistic campfire simulation game that lets you experience the warmth and charm of tending a fire. Build your bonfire, decorate the surroundings, and enjoy a cozy and relaxing fire experience. Add logs and branches to increase the fire\u2019s strength, cook food, and arrange your camping tools. Keep in mind\u2014the changing weather can weaken your fire at any time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920940/extras/ce4c516197f51f58edabdc8bcb81546b.poster.avif?t=1772603530\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920940/extras/ce4c516197f51f58edabdc8bcb81546b.webm?t=1772603530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920940/extras/ce4c516197f51f58edabdc8bcb81546b.mp4?t=1772603530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf32 Chop trees and gather firewood to manage your bonfire.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your campfire stays alive and burns stronger when it has something combustible to feed on. <strong>Firewood</strong> is always the best choice! Trees grow naturally around you, so chop them down efficiently, gather firewood, and prepare for the night without waste.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920940/extras/c5bbdb0d518a156be7266d1defa6c138.poster.avif?t=1772603530\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920940/extras/c5bbdb0d518a156be7266d1defa6c138.webm?t=1772603530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920940/extras/c5bbdb0d518a156be7266d1defa6c138.mp4?t=1772603530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf27\ufe0f Prepare for changing weather\u2014rain, snowstorms, and more.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will encounter various weather conditions while managing their bonfire. Heavy rain can extinguish your fire, and fierce snowstorms can drain your condition, leading to game over at any moment! Fortunately, there are useful tools to help you endure these harsh environments\u2014so hang in there and survive together with your fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920940/extras/c3d36ad940be2b25569e29a785a86705.poster.avif?t=1772603530\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920940/extras/c3d36ad940be2b25569e29a785a86705.webm?t=1772603530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920940/extras/c3d36ad940be2b25569e29a785a86705.mp4?t=1772603530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf60 Cook warm and delicious food over the campfire.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No campfire is complete without food! Roast sweet potatoes, warm yourself up with instant coffee, grill fish, or simmer a hearty stew. Each dish has its own cooking method and timing, so be sure to check the manual carefully!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920940/extras/8338995a61f2b5d9718f0143991abb39.poster.avif?t=1772603530\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920940/extras/8338995a61f2b5d9718f0143991abb39.webm?t=1772603530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920940/extras/8338995a61f2b5d9